{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786890515082,"sessionID":"ses_ff5086a9cffeOVVmWhMNGVn4l3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_00_CCHfl49bZT9WB0wKtyy20834","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/010-root-router-document-standard/.opencode/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/010-root-router-document-standard/.opencode/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: sk-doc Surface Router — per-intent leaf sets\n3: description: First-class surface router document at the sk-doc hub root (ROUTER.md). hub-router.json selects the workflow mode; this doc maps a request's documentation/authoring intent to the exact packet-local leaf resources that mode should load, emitting canonical (workflowMode, leafResourceId) pairs. Relocated verbatim from shared/references/smart-routing.md (v1.0.0.0) as the ROUTER.md consolidation pattern.\n4: trigger_phrases:\n5:   - \"sk-doc surface router\"\n6:   - \"doc authoring resource map\"\n7:   - \"packet leaf resource routing\"\n8:   - \"surface router pattern\"\n9: importance_tier: important\n10: contextType: implementation\n11: version: 1.0.1.0\n12: router_state: active\n13: skill_pointer: SKILL.md\n14: ---\n15: \n16: # sk-doc Surface Router — per-intent leaf sets\n17: \n18: This is sk-doc's second-layer (surface) router, first-class at the hub root as\n19: `ROUTER.md`. The hub selects a workflow mode in [`hub-router.json`](hub-router.json)\n20: (sk-create-skill, sk-create-readme, sk-create-agent, sk-create-command,\n21: sk-create-feature-catalog, sk-create-manual-testing-playbook, sk-create-benchmark,\n22: sk-create-diagram, sk-create-changelog, sk-create-diff, or sk-create-quality-control);\n23: this doc maps a request's documentation/authoring intent to the exact packet-local\n24: leaf resources that mode should load. Every path is either packet-qualified\n25: (`<packet>/references|assets/…`) or an authored shared-alias disk path (`shared/…`),\n26: and both convert to the canonical `(workflowMode, leafResourceId)` pair at the\n27: contract boundary (`sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/lib/leaf-resource-contract.cjs`).\n28: `FULL_INVENTORY` is the single explicit full-toolkit intent — no other intent\n29: enumerates the whole hub.\n30: \n31: Routing is two stages: the hub picks the WORKFLOW mode (mode telemetry), this\n32: router picks the LEAVES within it. The two layers stay separate — the hub never\n33: emits leaf paths, and this router never re-decides the mode.\n34: \n35: ## 2. MACHINE-READABLE ROUTER (replay / benchmark source)\n36: \n37: The single machine-readable projection of the intent model above. The prose is the\n38: human-facing contract; this block is the byte-for-byte source the deterministic\n39: router-replay parses. Keep them in sync: when a map row changes above, update the\n40: matching `RESOURCE_MAP` entry here. Every `RESOURCE_MAP` path resolves on disk and\n41: dual-reads to a canonical typed pair through `leaf-manifest.json` or the hub's\n42: `leaf-aliases.json`.\n43: \n44: ```python\n45: INTENT_SIGNALS = {\n46:     \"DOC_QUALITY\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"documentation quality\", \"doc quality\", \"validate documentation\", \"validation rules\", \"fail sk-doc standards\", \"review the docs\", \"review the documentation\", \"check the docs\", \"check the documentation\", \"audit the docs\", \"review bar\", \"quality bar\", \"flag\", \"meet our standards\", \"pass review\"]},\n47:     \"OPTIMIZATION\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"optimize\", \"token efficiency\", \"llms.txt\", \"llmstxt\", \"reduce tokens\", \"fewer tokens\", \"trim\", \"compress the doc\", \"slim down\", \"model's budget\", \"machine-readable index\"]},\n48:     \"SKILL_CREATION\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"sk-skill\", \"create a new sk\", \"create sk-\", \"skill.md scaffold\", \"skill.md and starter\", \"resource_map wiring\", \"new skill\", \"create a skill\", \"build a skill\", \"author a skill\", \"scaffold a skill\", \"reusable capability\", \"reusable helper\", \"starter reference docs\", \"new capability\", \"capability module\", \"package a capability\"]},\n49:     \"AGENT_COMMAND\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"agent and paired\", \"paired /create\", \"@analyze agent\"]},\n50:     \"FLOWCHART\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"flowchart\", \"ascii\", \"text diagram\", \"text characters\", \"decision tree\", \"decision branch\", \"process diagram\", \"flow diagram\", \"diagram the\", \"as a diagram\"]},\n51:     \"INSTALL_GUIDE\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"install guide\", \"installation instructions\", \"setup instructions\", \"how to install\", \"setup steps\", \"getting it running\", \"getting our project running\", \"running from scratch\"]},\n52:     \"HVR\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"hvr\"]},\n53:     \"PLAYBOOK\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"playbook system\", \"manual testing playbook\", \"testing playbook\"]},\n54:     \"FEATURE_CATALOG\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"feature catalog\", \"feature inventory\", \"catalog of features\", \"features overview\", \"capabilities\"]},\n55:     \"README_CREATION\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"create a readme\", \"readme for\", \"a readme\", \"front-page overview\", \"project overview\", \"getting started doc\", \"intro doc\", \"overview doc\", \"landing doc\"]},\n56:     \"CHANGELOG\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"changelog\", \"release notes\", \"version notes\", \"release summary\", \"what shipped\", \"since the last version\"]},\n57:     \"BENCHMARK\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"create a benchmark\", \"author a benchmark\", \"benchmark suite\", \"benchmark authoring\", \"behavior benchmark\", \"conformance benchmark\", \"model benchmark\", \"skill benchmark\"]},\n58:     \"DIFF\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"document diff\", \"doc diff\", \"diff document\", \"before and after diff\", \"before/after diff\", \"visual document diff\"]},\n59:     \"FULL_INVENTORY\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"full sk-doc toolkit\", \"all templates\", \"show the full\", \"entire toolkit\", \"everything sk-doc offers\"]},\n60: }\n61: \n62: RESOURCE_MAP = {\n63:     \"DOC_QUALITY\": [\n64:         \"shared/references/validation.md\",\n65:         \"sk-create-quality-control/references/workflows.md\",\n66:         \"shared/references/core-standards.md\",\n67:         \"shared/references/evergreen-packet-id-rule.md\"\n68:     ],\n69:     \"OPTIMIZATION\": [\n70:         \"sk-create-quality-control/references/optimization.md\",\n71:         \"shared/assets/llmstxt-templates.md\"\n72:     ],\n73:     \"SKILL_CREATION\": [\n74:         \"sk-create-skill/references/skill/creation-workflow.md\",\n75:         \"sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md\",\n76:         \"sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-readme-template.md\",\n77:         \"sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md\"\n78:     ],\n79:     \"AGENT_COMMAND\": [\n80:         \"sk-create-agent/references/README.md\",\n81:         \"sk-create-agent/assets/agent-template.md\",\n82:         \"sk-create-command/references/README.md\",\n83:         \"sk-create-command/assets/command-template.md\"\n84:     ],\n85:     \"FLOWCHART\": [\n86:         \"sk-create-diagram/assets/ascii-patterns/simple-workflow.md\",\n87:         \"sk-create-diagram/assets/ascii-patterns/decision-tree-flow.md\"\n88:     ],\n89:     \"INSTALL_GUIDE\": [\n90:         \"sk-create-readme/assets/install-guide-template.md\",\n91:         \"sk-create-readme/references/README.md\"\n92:     ],\n93:     \"HVR\": [\n94:         \"shared/references/hvr-rules.md\"\n95:     ],\n96:     \"PLAYBOOK\": [\n97:         \"sk-create-manual-testing-playbook/references/README.md\"\n98:     ],\n99:     \"FEATURE_CATALOG\": [\n100:         \"sk-create-feature-catalog/references/README.md\"\n101:     ],\n102:     \"README_CREATION\": [\n103:         \"sk-create-readme/references/README.md\",\n104:         \"sk-create-readme/assets/readme-template.md\"\n105:     ],\n106:     \"CHANGELOG\": [\n107:         \"shared/assets/changelog-template.md\"\n108:     ],\n109:     \"BENCHMARK\": [\n110:         \"sk-create-benchmark/references/shared/README.md\",\n111:         \"sk-create-benchmark/references/shared/worked-example.md\",\n112:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/shared/benchmark-report-template.md\"\n113:     ],\n114:     \"DIFF\": [\n115:         \"sk-create-diff/references/README.md\",\n116:         \"sk-create-diff/references/workflow.md\",\n117:         \"sk-create-diff/references/worked-example.md\"\n118:     ],\n119:     \"FULL_INVENTORY\": [\n120:         \"sk-create-agent/assets/agent-template.md\",\n121:         \"sk-create-agent/references/README.md\",\n122:         \"sk-create-agent/references/agent-vs-skill-vs-command.md\",\n123:         \"sk-create-agent/references/common-pitfalls.md\",\n124:         \"sk-create-agent/references/permission-design.md\",\n125:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/behavior-benchmark/behavior-benchmark-baseline-template.md\",\n126:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/behavior-benchmark/behavior-benchmark-index-template.md\",\n127:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/behavior-benchmark/behavior-benchmark-scenario-template.md\",\n128:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/conformance-benchmark/conformance-benchmark-contract-template.md\",\n129:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/conformance-benchmark/conformance-benchmark-fixture-manifest-template.md\",\n130:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/conformance-benchmark/conformance-benchmark-lane-config-template.md\",\n131:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/conformance-benchmark/conformance-benchmark-readme-template.md\",\n132:         \"sk-create-benchmark/assets/model-benchmark/model-benchmark-code-task-fixture-template.md\",\n133:         \"sk-creat