{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786890856493,"sessionID":"ses_ff5086a9cffeOVVmWhMNGVn4l3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_01_ET_CgNDWTB6rDTuehU8f0w34009","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":".opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor","pattern":"smart-routing|smart router|ROUTER\\.md|router_state"},"output":"Found 3 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/010-root-router-document-standard/.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md:\n  Line 238: | [`SKILL.md`](./SKILL.md) | Runtime routing instructions, invariants and the smart router |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/010-root-router-document-standard/.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/SKILL.md:\n  Line 57: This package is mandatory context for non-trivial Gate 2 routing. The live advisor scores prompts through `mk_skill_advisor`; this smart router controls which local documentation resources an agent should load while maintaining the advisor package.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/010-root-router-document-standard/.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/mcp-server/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts:\n  Line 221:   'smart router': [['sk-code', 0.65]],\n","metadata":{"matches":3,"truncated":false},"title":"smart-routing|smart router|ROUTER\\.md|router_state","time":{"start":1786890856445,"end":1786890856491}},"id":"prt_00afea6ec0014cwBcrer3Bhx0K","sessionID":"ses_ff5086a9cffeOVVmWhMNGVn4l3","messageID":"msg_00afe94aa001j7442X0KqW4eJt"}}
