{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786891241346,"sessionID":"ses_ff5086a9cffeOVVmWhMNGVn4l3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_ET_dYbCLWxXZcPPdmUVoJqW3362","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\n  \"openQuestions\": [\n    \"Whether GAP-3 should be a new doctor route or an extension of the existing parent-skill route (recommended: extend to mirror CI glob-enrollment)\",\n    \"Whether ROUTER.md should join the advisor harvest scope (current answer: no)\"\n  ],\n  \"resolvedQuestions\": [\n    \"Q1. Create command family invokes updated init_skill.py, parent-skill templates, and root-router-contract.cjs, and presents root ROUTER.md — CONFORMANT (iteration 1).\",\n    \"Q2. Doctor per-hub check 12 validates ROUTER.md two-state contract; fleet class gate is ROUTER-blind; no doctor route sweeps the seven hubs — GAPS (iteration 2).\",\n    \"Q3. CI workflow runs check 12 fleet-wide but omits ROUTER.md from trigger paths; advisor/validators/compiled-route/agents intentionally ROUTER-agnostic (iteration 3).\",\n    \"Q4. All smart-routing string hits (5 under .opencode/commands, 8 under sk-create-skill) are legitimate — legacy-rejection lists, migration notes, templates, references, contracts, test fixtures (iterations 1, 4).\",\n    \"Q5. Ranked update list produced (7 gaps: 3 functional, 3 documentation, 1 cosmetic) separated from 13 conformant surface groups (iterations 2, 3, 5).\"\n  ],\n  \"keyFindings\": [\n    \"All seven hubs carry conformant root ROUTER.md (router_state: active, skill_pointer: SKILL.md, four-part version); zero legacy smart-routing.md files on disk.\",\n    \"GAP-1: routing-registry-drift.yml trigger paths omit ROUTER.md, bypassing the only fleet-level ROUTER.md gate.\",\n    \"GAP-2: ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs (fleet class gate) and its class-H contract are ROUTER-blind.\",\n    \"GAP-3: no doctor route audits root ROUTER.md across the seven hubs fleet-wide.\",\n    \"GAP-4/5/6: three stale doc citations to the relocated legacy file (sk-code phase-detection.md:40,110; deep-alignment adapter §citations; deep-review ANCHOR:smart-routing).\",\n    \"GAP-7 (cosmetic): parent-skill-smart-routing-template.md filename retains legacy term; rename deferred.\",\n    \"Create family, mirrors, advisor, validators, compiled-route, benchmark replay, package_skill flat-section markers, playbook content, remaining agents all conformant.\"\n  ],\n  \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n    \"Flat create-skill flow as a ROUTER.md gap (flat skills have no root ROUTER.md; init_skill() correct)\",\n    \"doctor-update.yaml as a ROUTER.md surface (DB rebuild orchestrator, scope-excluded)\",\n    \"mcp-doctor / mcp.md as ROUTER.md surfaces (MCP server diagnostics only)\",\n    \"Skill advisor as a ROUTER.md consumer (harvesters walk references/assets frontmatter by design)\",\n    \"package_skill.py SMART ROUTING markers as a legacy hit (flat-skill section pattern, distinct surface)\",\n    \"Renaming parent-skill-smart-routing-template.md now (cosmetic churn, deferred)\",\n    \"A seventh-hub ROUTER.md gap (all seven active and valid)\",\n    \"router-replay.cjs as a legacy authoring hit (ROUTER.md-first with ordered legacy fallbacks)\"\n  ],\n  \"coverageBySources\": {\n    \"create-command-family\": 6,\n    \"doctor-command-family\": 5,\n    \"ci-and-tooling\": 6,\n    \"sk-create-skill\": 8,\n    \"seven-hub-sweep\": 8\n  },\n  \"convergenceScore\": 0.67,\n  \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n  \"graphConvergenceScore\": null,\n  \"graphDecision\": null,\n  \"graphBlockers\": [],\n  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-08-16T15:10:00Z\"\n}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/010-root-router-document-standard/specs/sk-doc/031-command-surface-router-awareness/research/lineages/dsflashgo/findings-registry.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/010-root