{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786891250069,"sessionID":"ses_ff5086a9cffeOVVmWhMNGVn4l3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_ET_8u175WDhqQugPqjmOhqK2959","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Research Dashboard — dsflashgo\n\n## Iteration Table\n\n| run | focus | newInfoRatio | findings count | status |\n|-----|-------|--------------|----------------|--------|\n| 1 | Create command family (.opencode/commands/create) ROUTER.md awareness | 0.85 | 6 | complete |\n| 2 | Doctor command family (.opencode/commands/doctor) smart-routing assumptions + ROUTER.md validation | 0.75 | 5 | complete |\n| 3 | CI scripts + skill advisor metadata/index + validators re legacy path / root ROUTER.md awareness | 0.70 | 6 | complete |\n| 4 | sk-create-skill smart-routing string hits (8 files) — legit vs stale | 0.45 | 8 | complete |\n| 5 | Seven-hub ROUTER.md sweep + remaining agents + dangling legacy citations | 0.60 | 8 | complete |\n\n## Question Status\n\n5/5 answered (Q1, Q2, Q3, Q4, Q5) — see findings-registry.json resolvedQuestions.\n\n## Convergence Trend\n\n0.85 -> 0.75 -> 0.70 -> 0.45 -> 0.60 (avg 0.67, descending then broadened at iteration 5)\n\n## Dead Ends\n\nConsolidated in research.md §12 Eliminated Alternatives (8 entries, all with evidence and\niteration traceability).\n\n## Blocked Stops\n\nNone.\n\n## Graph Convergence\n\nNo graphEvents emitted; graph gates not applicable.\n\n## Next Focus\n\nSynthesis complete — see research.md ranked gap list (GAP-1..GAP-7) and conformant surfaces.\n\n## Active Risks\n\n- Stale-dist warnings for @spec-kit/mcp-server and @spec-kit/system-skill-advisor dist noted at\n  session start; unrelated to this research lineage (no repo tooling was executed).\n- GAP-1 is a live CI bypass until the trigger-path fix lands.\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/010-root-router-document-standard/specs/sk-doc/031-command-surface-router-awareness/research/line